{"id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Pair.md","title":"Pair","display":"Pair","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Pair","parameters":["a","b","p"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Pair"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span><span>b</span><span>p</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：基础。有序参数：<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>、<code>p</code>。</p>\n<p>Kuratowski 有序对；不是有限列的另一个名字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Pair a b p)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists s (exists t (and (@ Single a s) (and (@ UPair a b t) (@ UPair s t p)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdbfd129fa484068\" href=\"?note=bdbfd129fa484068\" title=\"ZFC_Single\">Single</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a59f2cc15bf4d177\" href=\"?note=a59f2cc15bf4d177\" title=\"ZFC_UPair\">UPair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Pair a b p)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Single","status":"resolved","id":"bdbfd129fa484068","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_UPair|UPair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_UPair","status":"resolved","id":"a59f2cc15bf4d177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_UPair|UPair]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":787,"backlinks":[{"id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Pair|Pair]]"},{"id":"83d12bd81841a9d9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]"},{"id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]"},{"id":"8175e0e33cb0689c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]"},{"id":"5246e8124a12290c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MTBound|MTBound]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]"},{"id":"d1838ae56b7f2fbc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MType|MType]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]"},{"id":"6256c42a05f07d73","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CGenerateRow|CGenerateRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]"},{"id":"d526fda4e7f7fe48","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CConstraintBound|CConstraintBound]]；[[ZFC_CMeta|CMeta]]；[[ZFC_CScope|CScope]]；[[ZFC_Cons|Cons]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_MTBound|MTBound]]；[[ZFC_MTCtx|MTCtx]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_